  "prefLabel": "Spe 302.01 Types of Initial Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Spe 302.01 Types of Initial Licensure. The board shall issue one of the following 3 types of initial licenses to applicants who are eligible for them and who comply with the application procedures:\n\n(a) Full initial licenses as set forth in Spe 304 and Spe 305;\n\n(b) Conditional licenses as set forth in Spe 306 and Spe 307; and\n\n(c) Provisional licenses as set forth in Spe 308 and Spe 309.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Spe 300) #9125, eff 4-5-08; ss by #10906, eff 8-7-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/spe100-600.html"
